// Count of kept winning labeled hammings strictly below the upper central value.
// An empty below-set returns -1, not 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hbelc ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hbelc rank

IMPULSE hbelc 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hbelc" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
